com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_2474.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='PRO PALACE SPECIALIST AGENT PLATINUM Sm'  width='200' height='118'  alt='PRO PALACE SPECIALIST AGENT PLATINUM Sm' id='sml_image_view_77453' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137195420,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":true}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"100.37.46.5","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78595,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"711fd98fda2d82beec30664c03cbfeb1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi all...I just got engaged on New Years Day and I&#039;m so excited\/stressed in wedding planning! &amp;nbsp;My fiance and I would love a destination wedding and were looking into Cancun\/Riviera Maya. &amp;nbsp;We both have big families and both have 8 groomsmen and bridesmaids, so thinking we&#039;ll have about 100 guests attending, including children. &amp;nbsp;I spoke to my wedding specialist today and she recommends Azul Fives and I have been looking at Moon Palace. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Any suggestions\/recommendations would be greatly appreciated! :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- Veronica&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1882761,"PostDate":1421158720,"PostContent":"<p>Hi all...I just got engaged on New Years Day and I'm so excited\/stressed in wedding planning! \u00a0My fiance and I would love a destination wedding and were looking into Cancun\/Riviera Maya. \u00a0We both have big families and both have 8 groomsmen and bridesmaids, so thinking we'll have about 100 guests attending, including children. \u00a0I spoke to my wedding specialist today and she recommends Azul Fives and I have been looking at Moon Palace. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Any suggestions\/recommendations would be greatly appreciated! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>- Veronica<\/p>\n","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"veronicaisla@gmail.com","IpAddress":"100.37.46.5","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421157086,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"veronicaisla","Id":281715,"Name":"veronicaisla","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.87.237.180","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78595,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2780fe58a8ad2c6f32bf54741bd659c1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats and welcome to the site! Both of those suggestions are good ones in terms of resorts and both have a ton of information here. Definitely look through the forums for the resorts and read what past brides have had to say. I can almost guarantee that any questions you have, someone else has asked them and the answers are likely here! lol&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Take a look through the resort reviews too. Everyone is different in terms of what they want, or what they expect but the resort reviews will give you an idea.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Definitely a great travel agent is a must as well. Not sure where you are but if the US, there is a fantastic TA affiliated with this site that are DW specialists - Wright Travel. If in Canada, there are different agents that the ladies have recommended.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1882842,"PostDate":1421224611,"PostContent":"<p>Congrats and welcome to the site! Both of those suggestions are good ones in terms of resorts and both have a ton of information here. Definitely look through the forums for the resorts and read what past brides have had to say. I can almost guarantee that any questions you have, someone else has asked them and the answers are likely here! lol<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Take a look through the resort reviews too. Everyone is different in terms of what they want, or what they expect but the resort reviews will give you an idea.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Definitely a great travel agent is a must as well. Not sure where you are but if the US, there is a fantastic TA affiliated with this site that are DW specialists - Wright Travel. If in Canada, there are different agents that the ladies have recommended.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.wrighttra...cy.com\/inquiry\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck!<\/p>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283430199,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1393821808","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.163.47.9","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78595,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1b28bd11c42d156220c205f65ba92b45","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats on the engagement!! &amp;nbsp;We&#039;re doing Mexico as well, likely the Puerto\/Nuevo Vallarta area, but there seems to be quite a few people going to Riviera Maya so I&#039;m sure you&#039;ll find tons of helpful advice. &amp;nbsp;Happy planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1882861,"PostDate":1421228435,"PostContent":"<p>Congrats on the engagement!! \u00a0We're doing Mexico as well, likely the Puerto\/Nuevo Vallarta area, but there seems to be quite a few people going to Riviera Maya so I'm sure you'll find tons of helpful advice. \u00a0Happy planning!<\/p>\n","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"slfehr@outlook.com","IpAddress":"24.114.26.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420194177,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"pykx82","Id":281560,"Name":"pykx82","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.252.52.125","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78595,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9f3a4a586a6be5d90a199aba57bc65e5","RawContent":"[quote name=\"veronicaisla\" post=\"1882761\" timestamp=\"1421187520\"]\nHi all...I just got engaged on New Years Day and I&#039;m so excited\/stressed in wedding planning!  My fiance and I would love a destination wedding and were looking into Cancun\/Riviera Maya.  We both have big families and both have 8 groomsmen and bridesmaids, so thinking we&#039;ll have about 100 guests attending, including children.  I spoke to my wedding specialist today and she recommends Azul Fives and I have been looking at Moon Palace.  \n\nAny suggestions\/recommendations would be greatly appreciated! :)\n\nThanks!\n\n- Veronica[\/quote]Hello Veronica, \n\n\nCongrats on your engagement and welcome to the forum, you have started off on a good step by involving a specialist,  this forum has plenty of information regarding hotels in the Riviera Maya. another good family friendly hotel is Hacienda tres Rios.\n\nFeel free to ask away!\n\nHappy Planning!","Attachments":[],"Id":1882866,"PostDate":1421229136,"PostContent":"<p class='citation'>veronicaisla, on Yesterday, 02:18 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi all...I just got engaged on New Years Day and I'm so excited\/stressed in wedding planning! \u00a0My fiance and I would love a destination wedding and were looking into Cancun\/Riviera Maya. \u00a0We both have big families and both have 8 groomsmen and bridesmaids, so thinking we'll have about 100 guests attending, including children. \u00a0I spoke to my wedding specialist today and she recommends Azul Fives and I have been looking at Moon Palace. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Any suggestions\/recommendations would be greatly appreciated! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>- Veronica<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hello Veronica,\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congrats on your engagement and welcome to the forum, you have started off on a good step by involving a specialist, \u00a0this forum has plenty of information regarding hotels in the Riviera Maya. another good family friendly hotel is Hacienda tres Rios.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Feel free to ask away!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning!<\/p>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html'>http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1326825587,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78595,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3e094607e813d9717653d4a5b9f19729","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;welcome to BDW! &amp;nbsp;Azul Fives is a GREAT resort, especially with the remodel and new restaurants.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1882936,"PostDate":1421252757,"PostContent":"<p>welcome to BDW! \u00a0Azul Fives is a GREAT resort, especially with the remodel and new restaurants.<\/p>\n","Author":{"Signature":"<span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com<\/span><br>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/sp