{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.102.144.36","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78582,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9b3e3e7b512c9a4b2fb2926f10160054","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Is anyone selling raffia fans?? I have searched online, but only find some on ebay and the shipping is a bit high. Oriental Trading and most other sites are sold out. Anyone have any interested in selling??&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1882481,"PostDate":1420892260,"PostContent":"<p>Is anyone selling raffia fans?? I have searched online, but only find some on ebay and the shipping is a bit high. Oriental Trading and most other sites are sold out. Anyone have any interested in selling??<\/p>\n","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"maureen.mccarrick@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"173.189.254.200","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1415615607,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"MrsRoland2015","Id":281071,"Name":"MrsRoland2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78582,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1420972756,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9f57ec8f418345ac1bdc74e3826fae58","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am not using raffia fans, but am using the white silk fans from Michaels.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;They are beautiful and an option for you if you can&#039;t find raffia fans but really want some sort of fan.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I waited until Michael&#039;s had a 50% off coupon and I got 15 for $15 - so $1 each which is very decent!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here&#039;s a pic, excuse the ribbon - we ended up putting a tag on each fan.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i1194.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa365\/lskvegas\/kim\/91AE2B6C-9BB8-4F09-BDFE-92F13A78F8E6_zpsqzy1di4d.jpg\" alt=\"91AE2B6C-9BB8-4F09-BDFE-92F13A78F8E6_zps\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1882539,"PostDate":1420972720,"PostContent":"<p>I am not using raffia fans, but am using the white silk fans from Michaels.<\/p>\n<p>They are beautiful and an option for you if you can't find raffia fans but really want some sort of fan.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I waited until Michael's had a 50% off coupon and I got 15 for $15 - so $1 each which is very decent!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here's a pic, excuse the ribbon - we ended up putting a tag on each fan.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' style='width: 100%;' src=\"http:\/\/i1194.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa365\/lskvegas\/kim\/91AE2B6C-9BB8-4F09-BDFE-92F13A78F8E6_zpsqzy1di4d.jpg\" alt=\"91AE2B6C-9BB8-4F09-BDFE-92F13A78F8E6_zps\"><\/span><\/p>\n","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Currently have 44 guests, plus bride and groom \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399399802,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn