{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":3,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":119,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1882637,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":281650,"Name":"Brod63","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281650.jpg?_r=1420831294","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1421058410,"LastPoster":{"Id":281649,"Name":"Everly","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281649.jpg?_r=1421027393","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1882938,"PostDate":1421252957,"PostContent":"I didn't look into them extensively but there were some less then flattering reviews on yelp abou...","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Currently lurking on BDW just waiting on some info to help us decide on Punta Cana or Ottawa (which being 4-5 hours away is still destination right? Right? <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/blink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':blink:' \/>\u00a0)","Email":"seriouslyamber@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.237.87.24","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420744142,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281649.jpg?_r=1421027393","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Everly","Id":281649,"Name":"Everly","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.109.117.155","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78589,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"88c7855f66527a450a3efc74f0542342","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;If so, what is your overall opinion on them?&amp;nbsp; Any bad experiences?&amp;nbsp; Do you feel they&#039;re better than the local travel agent?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks so much! :D&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1882637,"PostDate":1421058410,"PostContent":"                <html>\r\n                  <head>\r\n                    <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                      body {\r\n                        font-size: 16px;\r\n                        font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                      }\r\n                      img .bbc_img {\r\n                        width: 100%;\r\n                      }\r\n                    <\/style>\r\n                  <\/head>\r\n                  <body>\r\n                    <p>If so, what is your overall opinion on them?\u00a0 Any bad experiences?\u00a0 Do you feel they're better than the local travel agent?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks so much! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n\r\n                  <\/body>\r\n                <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cbrody@citco.com","IpAddress":"24.184.135.35","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420747213,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281650.jpg?_r=1420831294","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Brod63","Id":281650,"Name":"Brod63","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"190.167.87.137","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78589,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f64a4aef9f5cb52e9aa9c0fe7959a673","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats on your dw in Nov, Brod63 and welcome to the forum!!! you&#039;ll find lots of great resources here to help with your planning decisions - well done on joining up :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For a visual focus + jump start your creativity even more, here&#039;s a magical wedding \"moment that matters\" Linc captured at a recent wedding in our magnificent Mayan Riviera, with more at the album link here: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152914104764487.1073741916.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Grand Sunset Princess Wedding Album&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-a-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xap1\/t31.0-8\/10869689_10152914108219487_795999660770592278_o.jpg\" alt=\"10869689_10152914108219487_7959996607705\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1882726,"PostDate":1421133907,"PostContent":"                <html>\r\n                  <head>\r\n                    <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                      body {\r\n                        font-size: 16px;\r\n                        font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                      }\r\n                      img .bbc_img {\r\n                        width: 100%;\r\n                      }\r\n                    <\/style>\r\n                  <\/head>\r\n                  <body>\r\n                    <p>Congrats on your dw in Nov, Brod63 and welcome to the forum!!! you'll find lots of great resources here to help with your planning decisions - well done on joining up <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For a visual focus + jump start your creativity even more, here's a magical wedding \"moment that matters\" Linc captured at a recent wedding in our magnificent Mayan Riviera, with more at the album link here: <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152914104764487.1073741916.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Grand Sunset Princess Wedding Album<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' width='100%' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-a-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xap1\/t31.0-8\/10869689_10152914108219487_795999660770592278_o.jpg\" alt=\"10869689_10152914108219487_7959996607705\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n                  <\/body>\r\n                <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280181860,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.237.87.24","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78589,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"70ccef520d97ebecfe50802347c90bf6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I didn&#039;t look into them extensively but there were some less then flattering reviews on yelp about them. And not just a \"They suck\" but detailed into what and how it went wrong.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Of course there were some nice reviews as well.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So maybe reach out to them and feel them out first before committing.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wish you the best of luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1882938,"PostDate":1421252957,"PostContent":"                <html>\r\n                  <head>\r\n                    <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                      body {\r\n                        font-size: 16px;\r\n                        font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                      }\r\n                      img .bbc_img {\r\n                        width: 100%;\r\n                      }\r\n                    <\/style>\r\n                  <\/head>\r\n                  <body>\r\n                    <p>I didn't look into them extensively but there were some less then flattering reviews on yelp about them. And not just a \"They suck\" but detailed into what and how it went wrong.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Of course there were some nice reviews as well.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So maybe reach out to them and feel them out first before committing.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wish you the best of luck!<\/p>\n\r\n                  <\/body>\r\n                <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Currently lurking on BDW just waiting on some info to help us decide on Punta Cana or Ottawa (which being 4-5 hours away is still destination right? Right? <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/blink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':blink:' \/>\u00a0)","Email":"seriouslyamber@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.237.87.24","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420744142,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281649.jpg?_r=1421027393","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Everly","Id":281649,"Name":"Everly","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78589","Title":"Has Anyone Used Luxe Destination Wedding Services?","LastPostDate":1421252957},"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
